istic slow-trickle, wrong-credential, both-reply-stall, cancellation, stale-generation, slot-recovery, descriptor-cleanup, and iOS/macOS validation rows. The byte-level SOCKS contract, remote destination and sanitized originator, exactly-one channel/no migration, bounded pumps, EOF/half-close/reset/cancellation/cleanup, M0 accounting, privacy-safe aggregate metrics, and M3 assignment seam remain review-passing. Both opaque renders are legible and unclipped.\\n\\nIndependent reviewer validation on 2026-07-21: "'`swift test` passed 276 tests in 25 suites; both PlantUML sources passed `-checkonly`; `task-board validate` passed; authored/resource diagram copies and recorded SHA-256 hashes matched; `git diff --check` passed.", type=outcome, description="Rework 01 reviewer changes-requested verdict for the remaining pending-capacity sequence contradiction")'"'" in /Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel
