    11	## Source-backed deadline audit
    12	
    13	- `HEVSOCKSBoundary.swift:284-290` enforces the pending-descriptor count.
    14	- `HEVSOCKSBoundary.swift:437-452` applies `SO_RCVTIMEO` only.
